# Versions of the existing monitoring stack (08-monitoring.md section 7), linux-arm64 release archives pinned by
# SHA-256 (published checksums: sha256sums.txt of the Prometheus releases, <archive>.sha256 of Grafana; verified
# against the downloaded archives). provision.sh refuses an archive with another digest.
